      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Chronic silicosis can be aSx, but many pts develop progress dyspnea and cough; consolidation, pulm HTN and resp failure ± Rt ventricular failure may develop in advanced dz"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 0,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": 0,
     "spaceBefore": 6,
